SNAKE IN THE GRASS	-		_DF^C
MJÖLLNIR	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> _D^C
   <#bbbbbb>Has movement followups on hit.</>
_!FLOW STATE	-		^A/^B/^C
        <#bbbbbb>The different buttons send JV in different directions.</>

